"""
scripts/generate_dataset.py
===========================
Synthetic e-commerce dataset generator for InsightForge AI -- Phase 3.

Produces six CSV files that mimic a realistic Indian e-commerce business:
    data/raw/customers.csv
    data/raw/products.csv
    data/raw/orders.csv
    data/raw/payments.csv
    data/raw/delivery.csv
    data/raw/marketing_campaigns.csv

A smaller sample copy is written to data/sample/.

Design principles
-----------------
* Deterministic -- fixed RANDOM_SEED ensures identical output on every run.
* Modular -- each dataset is generated by its own function.
* Realistic patterns -- seasonality, festive spikes, regional/category
  differences, customer-retention curves, trend drift over 24 months.
* Intentional data-quality issues -- missing values, duplicate rows,
  inconsistent capitalisation, invalid dates, numerical outliers, broken
  FK references -- at controlled, documented rates.
* No extra dependencies beyond the Python standard library and NumPy/Pandas
  (already in scope per AGENTS.md analytics stack).

Usage
-----
    python scripts/generate_dataset.py           # full dataset
    python scripts/generate_dataset.py --sample  # sample only (fast)
    python scripts/generate_dataset.py --both    # full + sample
"""

